<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Vincent van Gogh's Paintings</title>

    <style>

        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
        }

        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            background-color: #f2f2f2;
            color: #333;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        .container {
            width: 90%;
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 20px auto;
        }

        header {
            background-color: #F08787;
            color: #ffffff;
            padding: 15px;
            text-align: center;
            border-radius: 10px;
        }

        header h1 {
            font-size: 40px;
        }

        .content {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 250px 1fr;
            gap: 20px;
            margin-top: 20px;
        }

        .sidebar {
            background-color: #FFC7A7;
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            height: fit-content;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .sidebar h2 {
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        .sidebar ul {
            list-style: none;
        }

        .sidebar li {
            padding: 15px;
            margin-bottom: 5px;
            background-color: #eeeeee;
            border-radius: 5px;
        }

        .main-content {
            background-color: white;
            padding: 25px;
            border-radius: 10px;
        }

        .main-content h2 {
            color: #285A48;
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        .main-content p {
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        .responsive-image {
            max-width: 100%;
            height: auto;
            display: block;
            margin: 20px auto;
            border-radius: 10px;
        }

        .card {
            background-color: #FFC7A7;
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            text-align: center;
            margin-top: 20px;
        }

        .card h3 {
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .images {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: row;
            justify-content: space-evenly;
            align-items: stretch;
            gap: 15px;
            margin-top: 20px;
        }

        .image {
            flex: 1;
            min-width: 0;
        }

        .image img {
            width: 100%;
            height: 250px;
            object-fit: cover;
            display: block;
            border-radius: 10px;
        }

         @media screen and (max-width: 600px) {

            body {
                background-color: #F8FAB4;
            }

            header h1 {
                font-size: 28px;
            }

            header p {
                font-size: 15px;
            }
        }

        @media screen and (max-width: 900px) {

            header h1 {
                font-size: 34px;
            }

            .main-content h2 {
                font-size: 24px;
            }

            .main-content p {
                font-size: 16px;
            }
        }

        @media screen and (max-width: 500px) {

            .content {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }

            .sidebar {
                display: none;
            }
        }

        @media screen and (max-width: 768px) {

            .cards {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }
        }

        @media screen and (max-width: 480px) {

            .container {
                width: 95%;
            }

            header {
                padding: 20px;
            }

            header h1 {
                font-size: 24px;
            }

            .main-content {
                padding: 18px;
            }

            .main-content h2 {
                font-size: 21px;
            }

            .main-content p {
                font-size: 14px;
            }
        }

        @media (max-width: 600px) {

            .content {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }

            .images {
                flex-direction: column;
            }

            .image img {
                height: auto;
            }

            header h1 {
                font-size: 30px;
            }
        }

        

    </style>
</head>

<body>

    <div class="container">

        <header>
            <h1>Vincent van Gogh's Paintings</h1>
        </header>

        <div class="content">

            <aside class="sidebar">

                <h2>Menu</h2>

                <ul>
                    <li>Home</li>
                    <li>About</li>
                    <li>Settings</li>
                    <li>Profile</li>
                    <li>More</li>
                </ul>

            </aside>

            <main class="main-content">

                <h2>This is my favorite painting.</h2>

                <p>
                    I deeply love Vincent van Gogh’s paintings because they feel full
                    of emotion, movement, and life. His use of bold colors and expressive
                    brushstrokes makes every painting feel alive, as if the colors and
                    shapes are telling a story. I especially admire how he could turn
                    ordinary subjects, such as flowers, landscapes, and the night sky,
                    into something beautiful and meaningful. When I look at his paintings,
                    I can feel both peace and emotion at the same time. His art reminds
                    me that beauty does not have to be perfect, it can come from feelings,
                    struggles, and the way we see the world. For me, Van Gogh’s paintings
                    are more than just artworks; they are a beautiful expression of the
                    human heart.
                </p>

                <img
                    src="data:image/jpeg;base64,"
                    alt="Vincent van Gogh's painting."
                    class="responsive-image"
                >

                <div class="card">

                    <h3>Other Vincent van Gogh's paintings.</h3>

                    <p>
                        Vincent van Gogh’s paintings are famous for their bright colors
                        and expressive brushstrokes. His art reflects his emotions and
                        unique way of seeing the world. His paintings continue to inspire
                        people today.
                    </p>

                </div>

                <div class="images">
                    <div class="image">
                        <img
                            src="https://encrypted-tbn0.gstatic.com/images?q=tbn:ANd9GcTq7yLLyfym66N3wemzv-ZRnxGof3XWuijcR-UIESonRg&s=10"
                            alt="Vincent van Gogh painting 1"
                        >
                    </div>

                    <div class="image">
                        <img
                            src="https://encrypted-tbn0.gstatic.com/images?q=tbn:ANd9GcSi40vDdiP5HpAovXlUNXDMcxTKirqTf0oZ4w2vl37Nng&s=10"
                            alt="Vincent van Gogh painting 2"
                        >
                    </div>

                    <div class="image">
                        <img
                            src="https://encrypted-tbn0.gstatic.com/images?q=tbn:ANd9GcQoEz0CQDk0ikZUdGtIZ9eelHwnhRxsK_q-6_pFP5K8Rg&s=10"
                            alt="Vincent van Gogh painting 3"
                        >
                    </div>

                </div>

            </main>

        </div>

    </div>

</body>
</html>
```
